<atten4>
<ptxt>The capacity when replaced is the value when the oil is drained from the drain plug.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Use oil of a viscosity suitable for the outside temperature, based on the chart.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Tighten the drain plug after making sure that the old oil has drained completely.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Always perform a final check of the oil level with the oil level dipstick. (After warming up the engine, stop the engine, wait 5 minutes, and check that the oil level is at the F level on the dipstick)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
