<atten2>
<ptxt>For 2GR-FE models, Toyota Genuine Motor Oil (SAE 0W-20) cannot be used.</ptxt>
</atten2>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Other than the genuine product above, oil with API SM/EC, SL/EC or the ILSAC mark is recommended.</ptxt>
</atten4>
